One two three four...


01:51:27.238 --> 01:51:30.825
five, six, seven and eight.


01:51:33.620 --> 01:51:36.498
H6 G4, H6 G4. H6...


01:51:36.623 --> 01:51:38.625
Quiet.


01:51:38.750 --> 01:51:40.627
H6.


01:51:40.753 --> 01:51:42.963
To G...


01:51:45.299 --> 01:51:46.759
G4.


01:51:46.884 --> 01:51:51.055
H6 to G4.


01:51:51.180 --> 01:51:53.432
What should I do with it?


01:51:58.480 --> 01:52:00.858
Marco.
Polo.


01:52:15.916 --> 01:52:17.918
SECRET CARD
IN EVERY BOX


01:52:58.879 --> 01:53:00.590
This is it.


01:53:09.265 --> 01:53:12.018
My god, you were right.


01:53:12.144 --> 01:53:14.396
You were right.


01:53:16.232 --> 01:53:19.068
H6...


01:53:19.193 --> 01:53:21.278
to G4.


01:53:22.280 --> 01:53:25.909
That is the reservoir
and that's Mount Hollywood.


01:53:51.771 --> 01:53:53.272
NO SATELLITE IMAGE


01:53:53.398 --> 01:53:55.691
What is it?


01:54:21.136 --> 01:54:24.390
IT IS NOT SAFE HERE


01:55:17.322 --> 01:55:19.783
Can I do something for you?


01:55:21.076 --> 01:55:25.038
My friend Sarah was murdered.


01:55:25.039 --> 01:55:28.286
These three girls know more about it.


01:55:29.708 --> 01:55:31.338
Why do you think?


01:55:31.463 --> 01:55:34.299
I do not just think so.


01:55:34.424 --> 01:55:39.639
I saw that she took something
from Sarah's house...


01:55:39.764 --> 01:55:43.601
there was a message in the music
from their friend...


01:55:43.726 --> 01:55:46.897
and I've been in the tunnels.


01:55:48.106 --> 01:55:50.526
Have a seat.


01:55:50.651 --> 01:55:52.903
Take some tea.


01:55:54.155 --> 01:55:57.825
I discovered a shelter there.


01:55:59.911 --> 01:56:04.374
A kind of bunker, just in case
a nuclear war breaks out.


01:56:04.499 --> 01:56:07.669
It is not a bomb shelter.
What is it?


01:56:07.795 --> 01:56:09.546
A crypt.


01:56:09.672 --> 01:56:11.674
Was it ours?


01:56:13.756 --> 01:56:16.448
They are burial vaults for princes...


01:56:16.449 --> 01:56:19.808
like me and Jefferson Sevence.


01:56:25.897 --> 01:56:30.778
Why does Sevence need something like that?
Is the cemetery not good enough?


01:56:31.904 --> 01:56:36.576
It is not about funerals.
It is about taking off.


01:56:36.701 --> 01:56:41.915
Not about dying, but about the journey
to another, better world.


01:56:43.249 --> 01:56:46.086
Are you talking about heaven?
No.


01:56:46.212 --> 01:56:51.718
I'm talking about something
what is reserved for a few.


01:56:51.843 --> 01:56:54.135
About something real.


01:56:54.136 --> 01:56:57.182
Our souls are becoming
pulled out of our bodies...


01:56:57.307 --> 01:57:01.186
and by this impenetrable
fruit bag transported.


01:57:01.311 --> 01:57:06.149
Then we live outside this cosmos
together as princes...


01:57:06.275 --> 01:57:08.819
Without limitations.


01:57:08.944 --> 01:57:14.199
The pharaohs have done it too,
like many greats from history.


01:57:14.200 --> 01:57:17.871
Are you going to die?
I'm locked in a tomb...


01:57:17.996 --> 01:57:22.877
with my beautiful brides
and all my earthly possessions.


01:57:23.002 --> 01:57:26.922
Then we go delicious meals
to take us...


01:57:27.757 --> 01:57:32.178
drink wine, and we enjoy the TV
and the sex.


01:57:33.554 --> 01:57:35.891
We'll keep it here for six months.


01:57:36.016 --> 01:57:39.728
And then you die.
No, then we rise up.


01:57:40.896 --> 01:57:45.652
Only the rich can
to afford this. It costs quite a bit...


01:57:45.777 --> 01:57:50.615
to dig tunnels
and keep them hidden.


01:57:50.740 --> 01:57:53.535
But it costs more
to commit murders...


01:57:53.660 --> 01:57:55.996
without bothering you.


01:57:57.581 --> 01:57:59.625
Did you kill Sarah?


01:58:11.180 --> 01:58:15.810
These spaces will be a thousand years
stay hidden.


01:58:15.935 --> 01:58:18.312
In the future they will understand...


01:58:19.814 --> 01:58:22.232
that we were modern kings.


01:58:22.233 --> 01:58:26.780
Rulers without statues
or other images.


01:58:26.905 --> 01:58:28.949
She has been here.


01:58:34.956 --> 01:58:39.919
Is Sarah still alive?
Maybe she has already taken off.


01:58:40.044 --> 01:58:43.506
She's below
in one of those burial chambers.


01:58:46.426 --> 01:58:50.304
With Jefferson Sevence?
Yes.


01:58:50.305 --> 01:58:54.017
They had found his body.
Other people's bones...


01:58:54.512 --> 01:58:57.981
a large part of Jefferson's teeth,
a piece of skin...


01:58:58.106 --> 01:59:01.735
and all organs
he no longer needs.


01:59:06.281 --> 01:59:08.826
What anger was behind it.


01:59:13.623 --> 01:59:15.958
Why are you angry?


01:59:18.253 --> 01:59:20.421
I just want to see Sarah.


01:59:23.800 --> 01:59:26.547
We can try to call her.


01:59:27.763 --> 01:59:32.974
Do they have a phone?
Not for outgoing calls.


01:59:33.975 --> 01:59:35.737
Sometimes they get scared
and want to leave.


01:59:35.772 --> 01:59:39.692
Is she locked in there?
You do not want to miss eternal life...


01:59:39.817 --> 01:59:45.574
because we have a physical dislike
of a closed underground space.


01:59:45.699 --> 01:59:49.120
That is a very human reaction.


02:00:00.715 --> 02:00:02.843
How are you?


02:00:06.472 --> 02:00:09.099
Beautiful.


02:00:09.594 --> 02:00:12.103
Is it okay if I turn on the image?


02:00:13.063 --> 02:00:17.358
There is a friend here
that you want to see. Alright.


02:00:30.207 --> 02:00:33.877
Can you hear me, Sarah?
Yes.


02:00:40.133 --> 02:00:43.679
I was looking for you.
Oh yeah?


02:00:46.182 --> 02:00:49.060
You hardly know me.


02:00:49.185 --> 02:00:51.187
I know that.


02:00:52.439 --> 02:00:57.194
Are you angry? Did I do something wrong?
Will I get angry about it?


02:00:58.779 --> 02:01:02.700
I am not angry, I just wanted to know
where you stayed.


02:01:04.827 --> 02:01:07.657
Do you really want to stay there?


02:01:13.420 --> 02:01:14.880
Yes.


02:01:15.965 --> 02:01:18.718
You will die there.


02:01:22.263 --> 02:01:23.931
Do you really want that?


02:01:27.978 --> 02:01:33.150
I talk further along. You hang
on when I have recorded there?


02:01:43.537 --> 02:01:48.918
Their room is under a thick layer
concrete buried. They can not leave.


02:01:49.043 --> 02:01:53.297
Do not make her upset.
Be nice to her.


02:02:05.644 --> 02:02:09.145
I got him.


02:02:14.153 --> 02:02:20.077
Should not I have done it?
Should not I have gone here?


02:02:23.288 --> 02:02:24.998
I do not know.


02:02:39.473 --> 02:02:43.769
I can not leave now,
so I only make the most of it.


02:03:02.623 --> 02:03:05.787
That also counts for me.


02:03:09.381 --> 02:03:11.090
Anyway...


02:03:11.216 --> 02:03:13.676
how are you?


02:03:17.723 --> 02:03:20.558
Not too good.


02:03:20.559 --> 02:03:24.105
Have you ever thought
about a new dog?


02:03:28.693 --> 02:03:32.572
No.
Maybe it would be good for you.


02:03:32.697 --> 02:03:35.951
Some unconditional love.


02:03:37.912 --> 02:03:39.997
I will think about it.


02:03:51.552 --> 02:03:54.971
I have to hang up,
I would cook tonight.


02:03:55.097 --> 02:03:58.264
I still have so much to do.


02:04:00.687 --> 02:04:04.191
Tasty food then.


02:04:07.152 --> 02:04:08.987
Take care of yourself.


02:04:16.204 --> 02:04:19.287
Day.


02:04:42.774 --> 02:04:45.193
Yesterday evening...


02:04:45.319 --> 02:04:50.032
I saw us in a vision
the love companies underground.


02:04:50.157 --> 02:04:56.038
Then we went swimming together.
Naked, in a dark puddle.


02:04:56.163 --> 02:05:02.838
Then it happened. Our bodies
dissolved and turned into light.


02:05:02.963 --> 02:05:08.927
All the beautiful thoughts we have
ever had, surrounded us...


02:05:09.052 --> 02:05:12.473
and carried our souls through space...


02:05:13.432 --> 02:05:16.019
to another world.


02:05:16.144 --> 02:05:21.733
We were laughing all the time,
because we knew...


02:05:21.858 --> 02:05:25.279
that there will never be anything
would go wrong.


02:05:31.953 --> 02:05:35.206
I wish you would come with us.


02:05:42.506 --> 02:05:49.138
People with common sense
do not want to stay in this world...


02:05:49.263 --> 02:05:52.184
and do not worry about it.


02:05:52.309 --> 02:05:54.352
It is a fun fair...


02:05:54.477 --> 02:05:59.400
with small rings
huge soda bottles should throw...


02:05:59.525 --> 02:06:03.196
in the hope that you win a prize.


02:06:03.321 --> 02:06:05.281
What are you going to win?


02:06:07.116 --> 02:06:11.455
A two... week holiday?
A new car?


02:06:12.914 --> 02:06:17.294
A sum of money
with which you can start renting?


02:06:17.419 --> 02:06:19.547
It is no longer...


02:06:20.420 --> 02:06:24.344
then a stupid rabbit
that is filled with sawdust.


02:06:28.008 --> 02:06:33.479
The things you care about,
do not matter at our destination.


02:07:23.659 --> 02:07:27.413
How did you know I was here?


02:07:27.538 --> 02:07:29.498
We could smell you.


02:07:59.406 --> 02:08:02.659
What happened
with that man and those girls?


02:08:04.536 --> 02:08:08.165
They are now waking up
in the room from which they rise.


02:08:09.124 --> 02:08:12.545
Are you going to kill me now?


02:08:12.670 --> 02:08:15.548
Do you know what you did wrong?


02:08:21.513 --> 02:08:25.059
We found it in your pocket.


02:08:26.393 --> 02:08:29.939
Why do you have dog
biscuits in your pocket?


02:08:31.566 --> 02:08:33.944
I used to have...


02:08:34.069 --> 02:08:38.490
I liked a girl who had a dog.


02:08:38.616 --> 02:08:40.618
When?


02:08:44.330 --> 02:08:46.540
Long ago.


02:08:49.503 --> 02:08:53.173
Did she not love you anymore?


02:08:55.342 --> 02:08:56.886
That's right.


02:08:59.889 --> 02:09:03.726
Why are there dog biscuits...


02:09:04.599 --> 02:09:06.104
in your pocket?


02:09:08.690 --> 02:09:12.608
I was hoping she would want me back.


02:09:19.535 --> 02:09:23.247
I wanted to give the dog something tasty
and stroking his ears.


02:09:25.667 --> 02:09:30.207
Just like I used to do.
Then everything would be fine again.


02:10:01.372 --> 02:10:04.543
You can leave here.


02:10:04.668 --> 02:10:06.837
Really?


02:10:10.382 --> 02:10:12.176
So you're not going to...


02:10:13.720 --> 02:10:19.016
So you're not going to kill me?
Maybe. I am still in doubt.


02:10:21.263 --> 02:10:26.358
You obviously understand
that you can not tell anyone.


02:10:26.484 --> 02:10:28.110
Which is good.


02:10:41.208 --> 02:10:44.044
Day.


02:11:28.259 --> 02:11:32.341
HAMBURGERS ARE EQUAL
TO LOVE


02:12:09.304 --> 02:12:12.805
I'M NOT USED TO IT
TO BE HAPPY


02:12:16.187 --> 02:12:18.314
SO CRAZY: IT DOES PAIN.


02:12:32.412 --> 02:12:34.408
I'M AFRAID.


02:12:45.218 --> 02:12:47.638
DO NOT LET YOUR HEAD HANG
LOOK UP.


02:13:37.483 --> 02:13:39.570
Is that patchouli?


02:13:42.239 --> 02:13:44.906
No.


02:13:58.381 --> 02:14:00.759
What does that bird say?


02:14:02.219 --> 02:14:03.929
No idea.


02:14:04.054 --> 02:14:07.934
I always wondered,
but I have no idea.


02:15:08.268 --> 02:15:10.979
Damn. What is that?

